                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <STRONG><FONT size=5>2011年绍兴市属、绍兴县高中艺术类音乐模拟考试方案</FONT></STRONG>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p><FONT color=#000000 size=3><STRONG> </STRONG></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312"><FONT color=#000000>为检验市属、县高中艺术类音乐考生专业水准，了解、适应教育部关于艺术类招生新规定，并使考生在联考前有一个熟悉专业考流程的机会，经研究决定，特举办绍兴市属、县高中艺术类（音乐）<SPAN lang=EN-US>2010</SPAN>年模拟考试，现将相关事项通知如下<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312"><FONT color=#000000>一、报名<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT color=#000000><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">、<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-tab-count: 1">   </SPAN></SPAN>报名条件：绍兴县普通高中音乐应（往）届考生<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT color=#000000><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">、<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-tab-count: 1">   </SPAN></SPAN>报名地点：鉴湖中学音乐办公室<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT color=#000000><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">、<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-tab-count: 1">   </SPAN></SPAN>报名方法：各校集体报名，同时收取相应考务费，考务费另定。各校要进行充分的动员，每位考生都必须参加考试，在考试当日设有临时报名处，同时交纳报名费。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312"><FONT color=#000000>4</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312"><FONT color=#000000>、 报名要求：各校老师打印好本校报名考生的总名册，名册内注明考生姓名、就读学校、应往届，预留考生各组的分数及总分、名次等栏目，以便考试成绩的登记，并提前一周（<?xml:namespace prefix = st1 ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:smarttags" /><st1:chsdate w:st="on" Year="2010" Month="11" Day="21" IsLunarDate="False" IsROCDate="False"><SPAN lang=EN-US>11</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>21</SPAN>日</st1:chsdate>）前交于鉴湖中学王恒老师处。邮箱为</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: blue">whiteboy526@163.com</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT color=#000000> <o:p></o:p></FONT></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312"><FONT color=#000000>二、命题<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT color=#000000><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312"><SPAN style="mso-tab-count: 1">   </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">各校专业教师回避的原则，外请专家出题。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312"><FONT color=#000000>三、考试时间、地点<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT color=#000000><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312"><SPAN style="mso-tab-count: 1">   </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）时间：<st1:chsdate w:st="on" Year="2010" Month="11" Day="28" IsLunarDate="False" IsROCDate="False"><SPAN lang=EN-US>2010</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>11</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>28</SPAN>日</st1:chsdate>一天<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN></SPAN>早上<SPAN lang=EN-US>8</SPAN>：<SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN>开始<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312"><FONT color=#000000>（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>）地点：鉴湖中学艺术楼三楼、四楼。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 49pt; mso-char-indent-count: 3.5"><FONT color=#000000><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">A</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">（钢琴试场）<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-tab-count: 1">   </SPAN><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">   </SPAN></SPAN>音乐教室（<SPAN lang=EN-US>304</SPAN>）<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 49pt; mso-char-indent-count: 3.5"><FONT color=#000000><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">B</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">（试唱试场）<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">       </SPAN></SPAN>音乐教室（<SPAN lang=EN-US>405</SPAN>）<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 49pt; mso-char-indent-count: 3.5"><FONT color=#000000><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">C</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">（声乐试场）<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">       </SPAN></SPAN>音乐教室（<SPAN lang=EN-US>308</SPAN>）<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312"><FONT color=#000000>休息室：<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>楼多媒体教室<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312"><FONT color=#000000>四、承办学校准备<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT color=#000000><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">、报名：准备好《考试要求》、《考场规则》、以及《考场示意图》等指示牌，于考试当日放于校门口。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT color=#000000><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">、试场安排：试场编排好，标记明确。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; mso-char-indent-count: -1.5"><FONT color=#000000><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">、准考证制作：遵循各校考生分散编排，科学安排各考生的考试次序。准考证上注明姓名、学校及准考证号码，考生根据准考证号码按序进入考场。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT color=#000000><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">4</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">、休息室：休息室内应有明显的标志，明示各校考生的休息位置。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; mso-char-indent-count: -1.5"><FONT color=#000000><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">5</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">、报到处：开考当天设置在校园广场的醒目位置。上午<SPAN lang=EN-US>8</SPAN>：<SPAN lang=EN-US>00</SPAN>前安排两位相关人员，准备好各校考生的总名册、准考证、考场及监考人员的安排信息。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: -28pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0"><FONT color=#000000><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">6</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">、<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-tab-count: 1"> </SPAN></SPAN>监考培训：承办学校在考试前一天作好监考教师的安排和培训工作。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT color=#000000><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">7</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">、制作好考试的情况分析表（试卷分析表和成绩分析表）。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312"><FONT color=#000000>五、各校专业教师的工作<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 14pt; TEXT-INDENT: -14pt; mso-char-indent-count: -1.0"><FONT color=#000000><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">、做好考前动员和组织，向考生说明考试的要求、考场规则、考试时间及安排等。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; mso-char-indent-count: -1.5"><FONT color=#000000><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">、带队参加考试，在第一场考试前<SPAN lang=EN-US>40</SPAN>分钟到达考点，到校后安排好考生进休息室准备，落实准考证的领取发放，在考前<SPAN lang=EN-US>20</SPAN>分钟，提醒考生按准考证号码按序进入考场。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; mso-char-indent-count: -1.5"><FONT color=#000000><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">、各校专业教师在安排学生进休息室后，进入各自考场，并进行考试准备，以及考场环境的处理。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 14pt; TEXT-INDENT: -14pt; mso-char-indent-count: -1.0"><FONT color=#000000><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">4</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">、提醒考生声乐伴奏由考点统一安排，在考前半小时与伴奏人员合作。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 14pt; TEXT-INDENT: -14pt; mso-char-indent-count: -1.0"><FONT color=#000000><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">5</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">、考试结束后，各专业教师分工对成绩进行统计、登记，将成绩录入打印后一式六份分发，及时向考生作考试成绩的分析和总结。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312"><FONT color=#000000>六、考试规则<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 35pt; TEXT-INDENT: -35pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.5"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312"><FONT color=#000000>（<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）考生凭准考证在候考室等待，不准携带手机等对考试进程有影响的物品。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312"><FONT color=#000000>（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>）考生在考场必须遵守考场纪律，不准在考场周围大声喧哗。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 35pt; TEXT-INDENT: -35pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.5"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312"><FONT color=#000000>（<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>）<SPAN lang=EN-US>1~10</SPAN>号的考生至<SPAN lang=EN-US>A</SPAN>试场考试，<SPAN lang=EN-US>11~20</SPAN>号的考生至<SPAN lang=EN-US>B</SPAN>试场考试，<SPAN lang=EN-US>21-30</SPAN>号的考生至<SPAN lang=EN-US>C</SPAN>试场，然后按序依次轮换。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
    
